  "description": "OEDRO Cargo Trunk Liner mat is suitable for 2010-2024 Toyota 4Runner, with third-row seat Cargo Liner. Snap-in the clip to prevent the car liner group from moving or obstructing the pedals.\nFeatures\nLess slippery. High-walled design helps contain messes of any kind. Anti-skid nibs and underside texture keep FloorLiner HP in place.\nTPE material. TPE is a Thermoplastic Elastomer, Combines the advantages of rubber and plastic materials, so it has good resilience, durability, and flexibility.\nDurability. One of the best things about OEDRO floor mats is that they are developed with strong rubber. This gives them longevity in comparison to other styles of mats. Honda floor mats are quite flexible. The heavy-duty material is also capable of withstanding constant rubbing and contacting of shoes.\nExcellent Visual Appearance. By adding an all-weather floor liner to your car’s interior, you will add color and class to your car. The mat’s unique appearance will accentuate the interior look of your car tenfold.\nProtecting the Interior. OEDRO Floor mats offer vehicles perhaps the most comprehensive interior protection in comparison to any other car mat. Your car’s carpet will remain clean and dry at all times.\nFitment\nFit for 2010-2024 Toyota 4Runner with 3rd Row Seats.",
